    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto-Remediation Workflows\n\nAutomatically responds to specific alert types:\n\n**CortexPodCrashLooping**\n- Deletes crashing pod (with approval gate)\n- Forces pod restart via deletion\n- Logs action to audit trail\n\n**CortexHighMemoryUsage**\n- Creates/updates HPA for deployment\n- Enables auto-scaling (min=2, max=10)\n- Monitors memory threshold\n\n**CortexTokenBudgetLow**\n- Sends Slack notification\n- Pauses non-critical workers\n- Preserves critical operations\n\n**Safety Features:**\n- Dry-run mode (set AUTO_REMEDIATION_DRY_RUN=true)\n- Per-alert enable/disable\n- Audit logging of all actions",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 620]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Safety Checks\n\n1. **Dry-Run Mode**: Test without executing\n2. **Approval Gate**: Manual approval for destructive actions\n3. **Audit Trail**: All actions logged\n4. **Per-Alert Control**: Disable via annotation\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- AUTO_REMEDIATION_DRY_RUN=true|false\n- SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://...\n\n**Alert Annotation to Disable:**\nauto_remediation: \"false\"",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 350
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1450, 620]
    }
